<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Safety-Kleen raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Safety-Kleen raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- CS First Boston said it raised its rating on Safety-Kleen Corp to buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- The analyst was not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>-- Shares were up 1/4 at 17.</p>
</text>
